TEXT:

"Please, calm down. We can still talk things through."

"No, enough talking!"

Frost snaps across my chest, creeping over my shoulders and locking me tight against the pine trunk. Ice encases me from the collar down.

"This ends now," Kate says, pulling her dagger back from my throat to prepare the finishing blow.

