The three of us start heading out of the clearing. Kate wears her hood and covers herself in her green cloak to hide her identity, moving cautiously to avoid attention. As we make our way out of the crowd, most people are pushing toward the center to watch the fight.

"Hey, watch where you're going you little runt!"

A roar cuts through the din behind us. A large mage, a head taller than Daren, glares down at Kate, who bumped into him. She tries to move past him, but the man grabs her by the cloak and hoists her off the ground.

"Don't you dare ignore me, you son of a--"

