ID: Ch7-Accept2
TEXT:

set(v_ac_ch7_hadrik,1) if (v_combat_technique == 4 && v_reflexes >= 3 && v_strength >= 2)
set(v_ch7_win_vs_hadrik,0) if (v_combat_technique == 4 && v_strength < 2 || v_combat_technique < 4 || v_reflexes < 3)
set(v_ch7_win_vs_hadrik,1) if (v_combat_technique == 4 && v_reflexes >= 3 && v_strength >= 2)
achievement("Defeated Hadrik",v_ac_ch7_hadrik)
#if(v_reflexes < 3) {
Even for a prod, his strike comes too fast to dodge. The finger connects, hurling me back four feet to hit the turf with a dull thud.

"Barry, are you okay?" Daren shouts as he rushes towards me.

"I'm fine," I answer him. "Maybe just a little shaken up."

"Well, that was underwhelming," Hadrik says, disappointed. "I guess I was getting my hopes up a little too much for this fight."
}
#if(v_reflexes >= 3 && v_combat_technique < 4) {
Prod or not, the kinetic force behind that finger will knock me off my feet. I sidestep at the last fraction of a second, grabbing his arm to pull him down with his own momentum. Instead, Hadrik clamps onto my sleeve, spins on his heel, and hurls me across the grass, sending me rolling into the dirt.

"Barry, are you okay?" Daren shouts as he rushes towards me.

"I'm fine," I answer him. "Maybe just a little shaken up."

"Well, that was underwhelming," Hadrik says, disappointed. "I guess I was getting my hopes up a little too much for this fight."
}
#if(v_combat_technique == 4 && v_reflexes >= 3 && v_strength < 2) {
Prod or not, the kinetic force behind that finger will knock me off my feet. I sidestep at the last fraction of a second, yanking his right arm with my left hand while shoving his left shoulder with my right to disrupt his balance. Hadrik tilts, but manages to latch onto my tunic. He spins and throws me across the turf, sending me rolling through the grass.

"Barry, are you okay?" Daren shouts as he rushes towards me.

"I'm fine," I answer him. "Maybe just a little shaken up."

"Well, that was underwhelming," Hadrik says, disappointed. "I guess I was getting my hopes up a little too much for this fight."
}
#if(v_combat_technique == 4 && v_reflexes >= 3 && v_strength >= 2) {
Prod or not, the kinetic force behind that finger will knock me off my feet. I sidestep at the last fraction of a second, yanking his right arm with my left hand while shoving his left shoulder hard with my right. Hadrik stumbles over his own boots, grasping for my jacket to catch himself, but my strength leverage carries him over. With nothing to halt his momentum, the dwarf crashes flat on his back with a heavy thud.

"Well, I'll be damned!" Hadrik says, staring up at the canopy. "You totally caught me off guard there, Barry. Well fought!"

"Haha, I can't believe you actually did it!" says Daren as he comes from behind and pats me hard on the back. "Maybe I've been wrong about you all this time. That move you did there was really impressive!"

"Aye!" the dwarf says, rolling to his feet. "This wasn't really the exciting fight I've been looking for, but a deal's a deal. Pack your bags, Kate, I'm going to lead you to your friend."

Kate looks at me, eyes glistening.

"Barry, I don't know what to say," she says. "Thank you so much..."
}
choice(""How about a rematch?"", Ch7-Rematch, v_current_scene = Ch7-Rematch) if (v_combat_technique == 4 && v_strength < 2 || v_combat_technique < 4 || v_reflexes < 3)
choice(""I was just caught off guard by your speed. Normally, I'm not so weak."", Ch7-Caught, v_current_scene = Ch7-Caught) if (v_combat_technique == 4 && v_strength < 2 || v_combat_technique < 4 || v_reflexes < 3)
